      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Menjalankan Verifikasi",
      "id": "run-verification",
      "intro": "Verifikasi adalah fitur untuk menguji rule sebelum diaktivasi. Anda bisa mensimulasikan rule dengan data sample untuk memastikan rule berfungsi seperti yang diharapkan.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Jalankan Verifikasi",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik **Run Verification** di toolbar editor\n• Pilih data sample (dari data yang ada atau input manual)\n• Klik **Run** — sistem mensimulasikan eksekusi rule\n• Hasil: ✅ ALERT, ❌ No Alert, ⚠️ Error",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#3b82f6;color:#fff;font-size:8px;font-weight:700\">▶️ Run Verification</span></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Membaca Hasil Verifikasi",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Hijau** — Node terpenuhi (true)\n• **Merah** — Node tidak terpenuhi (false)\n• **Abu-abu** — Node tidak dieksekusi\n• Lihat log detail tiap langkah eksekusi",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #99f6e4;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center\"><span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:#22c55e\"></span><span style=\"font-size:7px;color:#16a34a;font-weight:600\">True</span><span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:#ef4444\"></span><span style=\"font-size:7px;color:#dc2626;font-weight:600\">False</span><span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:#e2e8f0\"></span><span style=\"font-size:7px;color:#64748b;font-weight:600\">Not Executed</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Tips Verifikasi",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• ✅ Uji data positif (harus menghasilkan ALERT)\n• ✅ Uji data negatif (tidak menghasilkan ALERT)\n• ✅ Uji edge case (data di batas threshold)\n• ✅ Uji banyak sample dengan data berbeda",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f5f3ff,#fff);border:1px solid #ddd6fe;padding:8px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px\"><span style=\"padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:#f0fdf4;font-size:6px;color:#16a34a\">✅ Data positif</span><span style=\"padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:#fef2f2;font-size:6px;color:#dc2626\">✅ Data negatif</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px\"><span style=\"padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:#fffbeb;font-size:6px;color:#d97706\">✅ Edge cases</span><span style=\"padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:#eef2ff;font-size:6px;color:#4338ca\">✅ Multiple sample</span></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
